# Third-party notices - the Spell Research block for Magic Menu Rewrite @SPELL_RESEARCH_BLOCK_VERSION@

`SKSE/Plugins/MagicMenuRewrite_SpellResearch.dll` adds a Spell Research block to Magic Menu Rewrite's magic menu (the
archetypes of the selected spell and links to Spell Research's windows). It ships with Spell Research - Prisma UI 2 and
needs Magic Menu Rewrite to show anything.

## Licenses

- **The DLL is a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work.** It statically links **CommonLibSSE-NG 10.0.0**, which is licensed
  GPL-3.0-or-later with the **Modding Exception** and the **GPL-3.0 Linking Exception**. The DLL is distributed under
  those terms: `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt` (GNU GPL version 3) and `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md`
  (the two exceptions).
- **The block's own source files are MIT** (`MagicMenuRewrite_SpellResearch-LICENSE.txt` next to this file): the C++
  in the Heart of Magic repository's `plugins/SL_MagicMenu_SpellResearch/` except the two files below (and `Common.h`,
  `PCH.h` and `WideFileSink.h` from `plugins/`), the ini file and the language files. MIT is compatible with the GPL;
  files you take from it on their own stay MIT.

## Parts from Spell Research - Prisma UI by Innocento (used with the author's permission)

These two files are Innocento's work, not this project's, and are not under its MIT license. Spell Research - Prisma
UI's source files (0.2.0) carry no license file; they are used here with the author's permission.

- `plugins/SL_MagicMenu_SpellResearch/src/SRPrismaAPI.h` declares Spell Research - Prisma UI's interface, which the
  block calls to open its windows.
- `plugins/SL_MagicMenu_SpellResearch/src/ArchetypeIcons.h` is generated (`tools/sr-icons/convert.mjs` in the Heart of
  Magic repository) from Spell Research - Prisma UI's own archetype icons (`tools/icons/skald-icons.js` of its
  repository).

## Corresponding Source

The complete Corresponding Source for the DLL is public at <https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic>, tag
`spell-research-block-v@SPELL_RESEARCH_BLOCK_VERSION@`, made on the commit this package was built from when Spell
Research - Prisma UI 2 is released. CommonLibSSE-NG is its git
submodule `plugins/external/commonlibsse-ng` at tag `v10.0.0` (<https://github.com/alandtse/CommonLibVR>, branch `ng`);
`git submodule update --init --recursive` fetches it. The third-party libraries below come from the vcpkg manifest
`vcpkg.json`. Building: `BuildRelease.ps1` (see the repository's README and CLAUDE.md); the build puts these files in
`dist/SpellResearchBlock_@SPELL_RESEARCH_BLOCK_VERSION@/`.

## Libraries in the DLL

Linked statically or compiled in from headers (vcpkg triplet `x64-windows-static`). Their license texts are in
`licenses/`.

| Library | Version | License | License text |
|---|---|---|---|
| CommonLibSSE-NG | 10.0.0 | GPL-3.0-or-later + Modding Exception + GPL-3.0 Linking Exception | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt`, `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md` |
| CommonLibSSE (the original code by Ryan-rsm-McKenzie that CommonLibSSE-NG grew from) | - | MIT (kept for attribution) | `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/LICENSE-MIT.txt` |
| {fmt} | 12.1.0 | MIT | `licenses/fmt.txt` |
| spdlog | 1.17.0 | MIT | `licenses/spdlog.txt` |
| JSON for Modern C++ (nlohmann-json) | 3.12.0 | MIT | `licenses/nlohmann-json.txt` |
| Xbyak | 7.28 | BSD-3-Clause | `licenses/xbyak.txt` |
| DirectXMath | 2025-04-03 | MIT | `licenses/directxmath.txt` |
| DirectX Tool Kit (DirectXTK) | 2025-10-27 | MIT | `licenses/directxtk.txt` |

The Microsoft C/C++ runtime (CRT) is linked statically under the Visual Studio redistribution terms.
